89 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 72 0 R
/E (ToyJoy sells toys through retail and online channels and faced major inventory planning issues after recent holiday seasons. Some products remained heavily overstocked, tying up warehouse capacity and cash, while high-demand products frequently ran out of stock, causing missed sales opportunities. This analysis evaluates sales, inventory levels, and seasonal demand patterns over the last three years to identify inventory inefficiencies and improve stock planning.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
