/Title (Business Question Answer Suggest strategies to optimize reorder points and quantities to reduce overstock and stockouts. Reorder points should be increased for high-demand products, especially Educational Toys and top Action Figures. For slow-moving products, reorder quantities should be reduced and replenishment should happen less frequently. Seasonal demand should also be considered while planning stock for festivals, holidays, and Back-to-School periods. This will help ToyJoy maintain a better inventory balance.)
