/Title (Business Question Answer Recommend inventory adjustments for underperforming and high-demand products. ToyJoy should reduce stock for slow-moving products in Puzzles and Dolls, especially products with high stock and low revenue. At the same time, high-demand products such as Math Learning Kit, STEM Kit, Coding Toy, and Superhero Figure should be stocked more aggressively. This will reduce blocked inventory while improving product availability for strong sellers.)
